 ll probably give you “diarheoaha of the mind'. She doesn’t know how to 
 spell diarhreoaha\, but hopes you understand she means like the stinky dark
  water. The show is one part stand-up\, one part variety show\, horrible gu
 ests and some other crap too. Each night is different\, like a snowflake. D
 id you know that? Every snowflake is different. Like this show. I feel like
  you’re not understanding me.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-
 atlas/event/patti-harrison-just-ironing-some-things-out/
